email.layout:
{body}

Open the yup: {link}

You’re getting this email because you’re part of yup {code} on {productName}. These emails never include the terms; sign in to see them.

staffAlert.body:
A new report on {productName} is waiting for review. Every report is reviewed within 24 hours.

Open the review queue: {link}

You’re getting this email because you review reports on {productName}. It never says what a report is about; sign in to read it.

accountsCombined.body:
Two {productName} accounts, each signed in to with one of your email addresses or phone numbers, were just combined into one. Everything from both is in that account now, and you sign in to it with the email address or phone number it kept.

See your account: {link}

If you didn’t do this, write to support@yuppers.app straight away. This email says nothing about your yups; sign in to see them.

emailChanged.body:
The email address on your {productName} account was just changed to another one, by someone signed in who entered codes sent to the new address and to the account. This address is no longer on the account, and you can’t sign in with it.

See your account: {link}

If you didn’t do this, write to support@yuppers.app straight away.

emailRemoved.body:
This email address was just removed from your {productName} account, by someone signed in who entered a code sent to the account’s phone number. You can’t sign in with this address any more.

See your account: {link}

If you didn’t do this, write to support@yuppers.app straight away.
